            "No surprise here: Cubs star Pete Crow-Armstrong is one of top three votegetters for NL MVP, along with Shohei Ohtani and Brice Turang. The annual BBWAA award winner will be revealed on Nov. 12. PCA led MLB with a 10.6 fWAR -- 2nd-highest mark in a season in Cubs history (11.0 by Hornsby in 1929)."
